Z||000003||StansGT||11-20-2001||08:48 PM||||Yup, From Sneek,NL My family moved from there in late 79'..<BR>We farmed where "Bons" is now.<BR>All of my family is there, Mostly the Kalteren side. I live in Michigan, USA now.<P>Its really awsome to see Dutch people with Fiero's, I would'nt have emagined anyone shipping these cars there, other than for personal military vehicle purposes.<P>------------------<BR>Stock 87 GT<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stansig.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000004||StansGT||11-20-2001||08:58 PM||||Yup. My family moved from Sneek,NL, in late 79'. We farmed where "Bons" business park is now. <BR>I speak Friese at home, not "old" dutch. Most of my family is still over there "Kalteren" is their last name, but my last name is Hoekstra. <BR>I think its really awsome that there was Fiero's shipped over there, but I always wondered if they were shipped for military personal vehicles, or by native Dutch for some other reasons.<P>------------------<BR>Stock 87 GT<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stansig.jpg"> ||||reg||7
